  "title": "RESERVOIR ANNOUNCES A JOINT VENTURE WITH U.K. A&R EXECUTIVE OLLIE HODGE AND HIS LABEL, SOME ACTION",
  "summary": "Partnership expands Reservoir frontline label operations out of London Reservoir Media, Inc. (NASDAQ: RSVR), an award-winning independent music company, today announced a new joint venture with U.K. A&R executive Ollie Hodge to bring his frontline record label, Some Action, under Reservoir’s label operations. Based out of the Reservoir and Chrysalis Records London office, Some Action […]",
